WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:04.267
Everyone thinks the algorithm is hiding their posts on purpose.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.133
Here is the truth. Algorithms are not emotional. They do not hate you.

3
00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:12.033
They are just measuring.

4
00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:16.567
They measure watch time, comments, saves, shares, and replays.

5
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:21.500
These signals tell the algorithm one thing: does this content hold attention?

6
00:00:21.633 --> 00:00:25.167
If it does, the algorithm shows it to more people.

7
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.667
If it does not, it gets buried. Not because the algorithm hates you.

8
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:34.433
But because the content was not compelling enough to keep people watching.

9
00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:38.800
The right question is not 'how do I beat the algorithm?'

10
00:00:38.933 --> 00:00:43.300
The question is: why would someone stop scrolling for this?

11
00:00:43.433 --> 00:00:48.200
Creators winning today are creating genuine value — and the algorithm amplifies it.

12
00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:50.300
Master content strategy at 0xverse Academy.

